  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BRG support through UNOPS 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this programme United Nations Office for Project Services (UNOPS) aims to provide logistical, operational and administrative support for Indonesia&#x2019;s Peatland Restoration Agency &#xAB;Badan Restorasi Gambut&#xBB; (BRG) in its implementation of an ambitious agenda of restoring huge areas of degraded peatlands, and to establish measures to protect intact peatland forests, across 7 provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
